{"steam_appid":2510020,"steam_name":"Placid Plastic Deck - A Quiet Quest","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2510020/830492553/0f69178f578fe4adb98c5708b8d95ec40188ffae/1759503054/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760695396","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257211444/769ddd125e7ce1a184483ffea4a28faacccf4be8/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760695396","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/c897b0bd937db3ecf9026617cf4344b733c03071/ss_c897b0bd937db3ecf9026617cf4344b733c03071.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773936320","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/91657128684eb76e890808235d6b4c0844199a21/ss_91657128684eb76e890808235d6b4c0844199a21.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773936320","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/ce192c9cc9cdc930187671772c13e4c1ef93e151/ss_ce192c9cc9cdc930187671772c13e4c1ef93e151.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773936320","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/d819784e97272efe2e371032c679dd15f2733641/ss_d819784e97272efe2e371032c679dd15f2733641.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773936320","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/03cda378fe373524992ca2646e4c53b14fed3348/ss_03cda378fe373524992ca2646e4c53b14fed3348.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773936320"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A new adventure set in the beloved Placid Plastic Duck universe!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/f34f647b7e63e5aac54d53c717444a16.poster.avif?t=1773936320\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/f34f647b7e63e5aac54d53c717444a16.webm?t=1773936320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/f34f647b7e63e5aac54d53c717444a16.mp4?t=1773936320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Genre Mashup</strong><br>A surreal game featuring card battles and a sprinkle of deck-building mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A blend of adventure-game and RPG-lite elements, with multiple-choice dialogue and beautiful, old-school top-down pixel art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/d73721327eb64c225c40167f93671d5c.poster.avif?t=1773936320\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/d73721327eb64c225c40167f93671d5c.webm?t=1773936320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/d73721327eb64c225c40167f93671d5c.mp4?t=1773936320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>A Story of Friendship</strong> <br>You are Zoi, a teenage girl on a mission to make things right with her best friend. To do that, you’ll have to enter the regional card tournament and win the grand prize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only problem is… well, you’re not very good at cards. Or rather, you’re really bad. Actually, you don’t even know the rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/57c37694172edcaaefec72d2406dd8a8.poster.avif?t=1773936320\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/57c37694172edcaaefec72d2406dd8a8.webm?t=1773936320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/57c37694172edcaaefec72d2406dd8a8.mp4?t=1773936320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Duck Cards Galore</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the card game. Challenge and defeat eccentric and evil characters, each with their own unique deck, to move forward in your quest  armed only with a deck of ducks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the world, search for additional cards, and expand your deck. The ducks hide in the most surprising places… but they love you. Your collection will follow you until the end, and maybe even beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/7dbdb147fa070c165174f97ce03a5f8c.poster.avif?t=1773936320\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/7dbdb147fa070c165174f97ce03a5f8c.webm?t=1773936320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510020/extras/7dbdb147fa070c165174f97ce03a5f8c.mp4?t=1773936320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big decisions await you along the way. Choose your answers. Stick to your values. Let the future unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The universe of Placid Plastic Duck Simulator is expanding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ducks are going on an adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Join them.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure"],"developers":["turbolento games","Fantastico Studio"],"publishers":["turbolento publishing","Fantastico Studio"],"release_date":"17 Feb, 2026"}